## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s ChatFilter|r 1.2.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Shows guild chat only from the guilds you choose, and can hide guild recruitment adverts. Pick which of your guilds -- and their officer channels -- reach the chat window; the rest are dropped before they are ever added. Optionally hides any message carrying a guild link, which is what a Guild Finder recruitment advert is. Everything else (zone, say, yell, whisper, group, emote, system) is left exactly as it was. Settings panel, or /pbfilter.
## Version: 1.2.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsChatFilter_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Settings.lua

